  {
   "id": "REVIEW__body",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 480.59236316506156,
   "y": 942.2717180554835,
   "width": 299.76666259765625,
   "height": 105,
   "text": "active \u00b7 CI-fix + code-review + QA-findings on ONE worklist\nNO CI-first queue (v7 collapse of CI_REVIEW+CODE_REVIEW)\nself-loops: review.received/item_ready / dispatch_epoch \u00b7\nepoch.committed/replied/declined / disposition \u00b7\nci.signal(failing)[no_inflight \u2227 under_cap] / ciFix, inc rounds \u00b7\nci.signal(green|absent) / reset ci_fix_rounds (FG-2) \u00b7\nhead.changed / advance, set_code_changed, clear_qa \u00b7\nhead.noop_changed / advance (+ restamp_qa if \u00acchanged)",
   "fontSize": 10.5,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#4b5563",
