   "x": 119.94468560254023,
   "y": 1252.7404176281684,
   "width": 347.0333251953125,
   "height": 65.625,
   "text": "QA child runs the app @head (other team owns internals)\nemits ONE terminal verdict \u00b7 spine owns head-stamp/caps/deadline\nself-loops: head.changed / kill_qa, redispatch_qa (no run burn) \u00b7\nhead.noop_changed / restamp_qa \u00b7 review.received / queue \u00b7\nqa.*[event.head_sha \u2260 qa_run_head] / GHOST DISCARD log_noop (FG-1)",
