  {
   "id": "v7box",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1804.5618419412758,
   "y": 429.49923675785476,
   "width": 319.3666687011719,
   "height": 96.25,
   "text": "v7 collapse (review-loop latency):\n\u2022 CI_REVIEW + CODE_REVIEW \u2192 one REVIEW (17\u219216 states)\n\u2022 no CI-first queue; reviews actionable on arrival\n\u2022 eager dispatch \u2014 only gate is no_inflight \u2227 actionable\n\u2022 CI validated reactively per pushed head\n\u2022 durable-exec on existing DO+D1 (DE-1..DE-5);\n  happy-path timers = per-session DO alarms, not cron",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#3b6aa8",
   "groupIds": [],
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11,
   "seed": 1420807190,
   "version": 180,
   "versionNonce": 1126940868,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "updated": 1782699695822,
   "locked": false,
   "link": null,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "boundElements": [],
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "index": "b0u",
   "originalText": "v7 collapse (review-loop latency):\n\u2022 CI_REVIEW + CODE_REVIEW \u2192 one REVIEW (17\u219216 states)\n\u2022 no CI-first queue; reviews actionable on arrival\n\u2022 eager dispatch \u2014 only gate is no_inflight \u2227 actionable\n\u2022 CI validated reactively per pushed head\n\u2022 durable-exec on existing DO+D1 (DE-1..DE-5);\n  happy-path timers = per-session DO alarms, not cron",
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "v8box",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1804.5618419412758,
   "y": 579.4992367578548,
   "width": 312.5666809082031,
   "height": 96.25,
   "text": "v8 latency-optimality pins (timing only \u2014 NO\nchange to conjunction / cascade / caps / head-ownership):\n\u2776 eager epoch-1 for the actionable-review-present cohort\n    (CI-settled gate kept only for the no-review cohort)\n\u2777 first-contact no-show alarm armed at init_record,\n    per-reviewer-kind window: bots ~2-3m, humans = 0\n    (optimistic + re-open \u2014 a human never gates 1st caught_up)",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#7B4FB0",
   "groupIds": [],
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11,
   "seed": 1927759303,
   "version": 180,
   "versionNonce": 1023346756,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "updated": 1782699695822,
   "locked": false,
   "link": null,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "boundElements": [],
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "index": "b0v",
   "originalText": "v8 latency-optimality pins (timing only \u2014 NO\nchange to conjunction / cascade / caps / head-ownership):\n\u2776 eager epoch-1 for the actionable-review-present cohort\n    (CI-settled gate kept only for the no-review cohort)\n\u2777 first-contact no-show alarm armed at init_record,\n    per-reviewer-kind window: bots ~2-3m, humans = 0\n    (optimistic + re-open \u2014 a human never gates 1st caught_up)",
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "waits",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1804.5618419412758,
   "y": 719.4992367578548,
   "width": 354.29998779296875,
   "height": 55,
   "text": "Two intentional waits ONLY (\u00a715 inv 6):\n(a) CI-settled before epoch-1 \u2014 no-review cohort only (v8)\n(b) first-contact no-show window \u2014 binds only on a silent bot (v8)\nEverything else is eager: no cron tick, no CI re-confirm between epochs.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "groupIds": [],
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11,
   "seed": 287227768,
   "version": 180,
   "versionNonce": 1006460868,
