   "roughness": 0,
   "index": "b0y",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Hard-fail group {CREATED,PROVISIONING,GENERATING,FINALIZING,\n  PUBLISHING} on sandbox.death|liveness|spawn_failed|\n  max_duration|terminal{error} \u2192 FAILED (loud).\n  AWAITING_INPUT death \u2192 STOPPED(resumable), NOT FAILED.\n\u2022 Post-publish group {REVIEW,QA,MERGE_READY,NEEDS_YOU,\n  STOPPED} on pr.merged\u2192MERGED / pr.closed\u2192CLOSED.\n  + PUBLISHING N9 race: pr.merged\u2192MERGED / pr.closed\u2192\n    CLOSED (webhook beats publish.pr_opened \u2014 don't enter REVIEW).\n\u2022 user.stop \u2192 STOPPED (all non-terminal).\n\u2022 session.archived \u2192 ARCHIVED (non-terminal + non-final terms).\n\u2022 Deadlines: genesis/codegen/publish\u2192FAILED; AWAITING_INPUT\u2192\n  STOPPED; REVIEW\u2192NEEDS_YOU(review_stuck); QA\u2192NEEDS_YOU\n  (qa_stopped, coarse contract backstop, NOT liveness); MERGE_READY\n  \u2192 cron reconcile.\n\u2022 Resume (phase-aware) from STOPPED; QA resume = redispatch_qa\n  (no qa_runs burn).\n\u2022 kill_qa on every QA exit & terminal \u2014 no QA child outlives\n  the session.",
